{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"x":169.5,"mirrow":false,"y":-406,"img":"chara031_0","addImg":""},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":169.5,"mirrow":false,"y":-406,"img":"chara031_0","addImg":""},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"波特温","text":"[show]看见营地里有各种各样的人活动，我就想起哈萨琳了，她也是一个非常包容的人。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"波特温","text":"[show]她曾经邀请我加入联军，我拒绝过她很多次，因为我从来不信任那些魔物或者魔人。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"波特温","text":"[show]说来也是奇怪，我没怎么给过那些魔物魔人好脸色，他们却都摆出一副无所谓的模样。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"波特温","text":"[show]呵，不知道他们怎么想的，反正我的想法不会改变，哪怕哈萨琳已经不在了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"波特温","text":"[show]现在的深渊可真是一团糟……领袖的存在的确重要，但这并不代表我同意她的理念。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"波特温","text":"[show]我会用自己的方式融入这里。当然，跟你合作也是选择其一。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"}],"des":"波特温-熟识2","script":"yd_031_05"}